usage: plan.py set [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] (--json JSON | --file FILE)
                   plan ref

merge-patch plan, brief, a phase, item, decision or unit

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  ref                   plan | brief | Pn | Pn.m | D# | Pn.m/U#

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --json JSON           JSON text, or @file
  --file FILE           file holding the JSON
